Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:28:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Make the Fincra API base URL configurable

Requests went to a hardcoded Fincra host per mode. A gateway beside the site,
such as an AgentSafe proxy holding the Fincra credential, needs the module to
send its requests there instead. The new api_base_url setting accepts HTTPS, or
HTTP on the loopback interface only; empty keeps Fincra's own API.
